check 1
# Act I hireling follows through a level warp (q-chk-hirelings, REC-1518): hire from Kashya, then
# poke warp 2 (the Blood Moor, variant blood-moor-empty) at frame 40 and an idle cow (class 179) 6 sub-tiles
# along +x at frame 50: the hireling follows (hirelings.md §6) and fights it (hirelings-ai.md).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name hire-follow-warp-kashya
save ScnHrF --class bar --expansion --level 30 --gold 100000
seed 1234
ticks 200
seconds 500
channels state
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke goto unit 1:150
at 8 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:150
at 10 send InitEntityChat id=@1:150
at 14 send HireMerc npc=@1:150 merc=3411
at 40 poke warp 2
at 50 poke spawn 179 @x+6 @y normal
